 "text": "Hey, how's your day been so far? Make the bed, put a cushion on the chair and little bowls of fruit and cheese. guest room should really feel like proper bedroom, not a camp bed. A small bowl of fruit and some plain rye crisps and water jug on bedside table is enough. People appreciate being able to help themselves. Leave a note plus the password on a clipboard by the front door. People like being helpful and you can set the password so it needs a certain combination of letters and numbers. A small bouquet of roses or sweet peas in window is lovely. Just make sure they' real and not sprayed, they smell so much better.",
